                            <path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6" />
                        </svg>
                    </summary>
                    <div class="px-5 md:px-6 pb-5 -mt-1">
                        <p class="text-sm text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">Rincian biaya pendidikan dijelaskan langsung
